  "about_yourData": "Kumbukumbu ambazo timu yako inaingiza ni mali ya kituo chako, kama Masharti ya Huduma yanavyosema.",
  "@about_yourData": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "about_questions": "Una maswali?",
  "@about_questions": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_ownerTitle": "Kama unaendesha kituo (Msimamizi)",
  "@howToUse_ownerTitle": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_owner1": "Kwenye ukurasa wa kuingia bonyeza Jisajili, chagua \"Ninamiliki au ninasimamia kituo\" kisha bonyeza Endelea. Jaza kila hatua: kuhusu wewe, jina na aina ya kituo chako (bonyeza Ongeza), kisha barua pepe na nenosiri lako. Kwenye hatua ya mwisho kagua taarifa zako, weka alama kwenye kisanduku ili ukubali Masharti ya Huduma na Sera ya Faragha, kisha bonyeza Fungua akaunti.",
  "@howToUse_owner1": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_owner2": "Kituo chako kipya kinaanza na kipindi cha majaribio. Mipangilio, chini ya Usajili, inaonyesha muda wake na mipango inayofuata.",
  "@howToUse_owner2": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_owner3": "Fungua Bidhaa na bonyeza Ongeza Bidhaa. Chagua Orodha ya Bidhaa za Kuuza ili uiuze sasa, au Stoo ili uihifadhi kwanza.",
  "@howToUse_owner3": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_owner4": "Kuhamisha akiba kwenda rafuni, fungua Stoo na bonyeza Toa kwenye bidhaa.",
  "@howToUse_owner4": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_owner5": "Fungua Mauzo na bonyeza Rekodi Mauzo. Mteja akilipa chini ya jumla, kiasi kilichobaki kinahifadhiwa kama deni lake.",
  "@howToUse_owner5": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_owner6": "Fungua Huduma na bonyeza Rekodi Ziara ili kurekodi huduma.",
  "@howToUse_owner6": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_owner7": "Mteja anapolipa deni, fungua Wadaiwa, tafuta deni hilo na bonyeza Rekodi Malipo.",
  "@howToUse_owner7": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_owner8": "Kuongeza msaidizi, gusa jina lako kwenye upau wa juu, fungua Wafanyakazi na bonyeza Mwalike Msaidizi. Msimbo unafanya kazi kwa saa 48 au hadi utumike mara moja.",
  "@howToUse_owner8": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_owner9": "Akishajisajili, fungua Wafanyakazi na bonyeza Idhinisha.",
  "@howToUse_owner9": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_owner10": "Fungua Ripoti na bonyeza Tengeneza Ripoti ya Leo kupata ripoti ya siku.",
  "@howToUse_owner10": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_assistantTitle": "Kama unafanya kazi katika kituo (Msaidizi)",
  "@howToUse_assistantTitle": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_assistant1": "Muombe msimamizi wa kituo msimbo wa mwaliko.",
  "@howToUse_assistant1": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_assistant2": "Kwenye ukurasa wa kuingia bonyeza Jisajili, chagua \"Nina msimbo wa mwaliko\" kisha bonyeza Endelea. Jaza kila hatua: kuhusu wewe, kisha msimbo wa mwaliko (jina la kituo linaonekana msimbo ukiwa sahihi), kisha barua pepe na nenosiri lako.",
  "@howToUse_assistant2": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_assistant3": "Kwenye hatua ya mwisho kagua taarifa zako, weka alama kwenye kisanduku ili ukubali Masharti ya Huduma na Sera ya Faragha, kisha bonyeza Fungua akaunti. Kisha akaunti yako inasubiri idhini ya msimamizi.",
  "@howToUse_assistant3": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_assistant4": "Hadi hapo, ukiingia utaona \"{message}\"",
  "@howToUse_assistant4": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_assistant5": "Ukishaidhinishwa, unatumia skrini zilizo kwenye menyu ya pembeni kwa kituo hicho: rekodi mauzo na huduma, ongeza wateja na rekodi malipo.",
  "@howToUse_assistant5": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "howToUse_assistant6": "Msimamizi pekee ndiye anaweza kuongeza au kufuta bidhaa, kufuta mauzo, huduma na miamala, kuhariri huduma au muamala uliorekodiwa, au kufungua Wafanyakazi, Usajili, Takataka, Hamisha Data na Saa za Biashara.",
  "@howToUse_assistant6": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_startQ": "Ninaanzaje?",
  "@faq_startQ": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_startA": "Bonyeza Jisajili kwenye ukurasa wa kuingia, chagua \"Ninamiliki au ninasimamia kituo\" na ufuate hatua tano. Kituo chako kinaanza na kipindi cha majaribio; Mipangilio, chini ya Usajili, inaonyesha muda wake.",
  "@faq_startA": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_trialQ": "Nini kinatokea kipindi cha majaribio kikiisha?",
  "@faq_trialQ": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_trialA": "Unahitaji usajili ili kuendelea kutumia kila kipengele. Usajili ukiisha, kuna muda mfupi wa nyongeza; kisha kumbukumbu zako zinaendelea kuonekana, lakini mauzo mapya, huduma na maingizo kama hayo yanasimamishwa hadi utakapolipia tena.",
  "@faq_trialA": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_teamQ": "Ninaongezaje wafanyakazi wangu?",
  "@faq_teamQ": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_teamA": "Katika Wafanyakazi bonyeza Mwalike Msaidizi na mpe mtu huyo msimbo. Anajisajili kwa msimbo huo, na wewe unamwidhinisha katika Wafanyakazi.",
  "@faq_teamA": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_assistantQ": "Msaidizi anaweza kuona na kufanya nini?",
  "@faq_assistantQ": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_assistantA": "Msaidizi anatumia skrini zilizo kwenye menyu ya pembeni kwa kituo chake. Msimamizi pekee ndiye anaweza kuongeza au kufuta bidhaa, kufuta mauzo, huduma na miamala, kuhariri huduma au muamala uliorekodiwa, au kufungua Wafanyakazi, Usajili, Takataka, Hamisha Data na Saa za Biashara.",
  "@faq_assistantA": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_saleQ": "Ninarekodije mauzo?",
  "@faq_saleQ": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_saleA": "Fungua Mauzo na bonyeza Rekodi Mauzo. Mteja akilipa chini ya jumla, kiasi kilichobaki kinahifadhiwa kama deni lake chini ya Wadaiwa.",
  "@faq_saleA": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_serviceQ": "Ninarekodije huduma?",
  "@faq_serviceQ": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_serviceA": "Fungua Huduma na bonyeza Rekodi Ziara.",
  "@faq_serviceA": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_printQ": "Ninachapishaje risiti?",
  "@faq_printQ": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_printA": "Kwenye programu ya simu, Chapisha Risiti inaituma kwa printa ya joto ya Bluetooth, iliyowekwa katika Mipangilio chini ya Mipangilio ya Printa na Risiti. Kwenye kivinjari printa ya joto haifanyi kazi: chagua Muundo wa A4 ili kuchapisha risiti au kuihifadhi kama PDF.",
  "@faq_printA": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_deletedQ": "Nimefuta kitu kwa makosa. Nifanye nini?",
  "@faq_deletedQ": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_deletedA": "Baada ya kufuta mauzo, huduma, bidhaa, mteja au muamala, bonyeza Tendua kwenye ujumbe unaoonekana kwa sekunde chache. Vitu vilivyofutwa pia huenda kwenye Takataka (Mipangilio, kwa wasimamizi pekee), ambapo msimamizi anaweza kuvirejesha ndani ya siku 30; baada ya hapo vinafutwa kabisa.",
  "@faq_deletedA": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_passwordQ": "Nimesahau nenosiri langu.",
  "@faq_passwordQ": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_passwordA": "Kwenye ukurasa wa kuingia andika barua pepe yako na ubonyeze Umesahau Nenosiri?. Kama kuna akaunti ya barua pepe hiyo, kiungo cha kubadilisha nenosiri kinatumwa; angalia pia folda ya spam.",
  "@faq_passwordA": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_languageQ": "Ninabadilishaje lugha?",
  "@faq_languageQ": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_languageA": "Fungua Mipangilio na uchague Language / Lugha: Kiingereza au Kiswahili.",
  "@faq_languageA": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_themeQ": "Ninabadilishaje rangi au kutumia Hali ya Giza?",
  "@faq_themeQ": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_themeA": "Fungua Mipangilio, kisha Mipangilio ya Mwonekano. Chagua mandhari ya rangi (Malisho, Kliniki, Mavuno au Daftari) na Hali ya Giza (Kama Kifaa, Mwanga au Giza). Chaguo linahifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki.",
  "@faq_themeA": {"x-review":"draft"},
  "faq_supportQ": "Ninawasilianaje na msaada?",
